[h1]Probably MCM — Mod Configuration Menu[/h1]

[b]Probably MCM[/b] is a universal, responsive in-game Mod Configuration Menu (MCM) and developer framework for [i]Probably Stolen[/i].

[b]Author:[/b] Raul Moreau
[b]GitHub Repository:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM]https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM[/url]
[b]Developer Guide:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM/blob/main/Documentation.md]Documentation.md[/url]

[hr][/hr]
[h2]🌐 Languages[/h2]
• [url=#en]English[/url]
• [url=#ru]Русский[/url]
